# 无 Flutter 链路启动器与无 Dart 包（Q3）

2026-10-27。不改射频、不发帧；`-Run` 未执行。

## 构件

| 文件 | 作用 |
| --- | --- |
| `tools/Start-Chain.ps1` | 按序启动 radio → bridge → netd → awdld → receiver；默认 dry-run，`-Run` 才真正启动 |
| `tools/Package-Headless.ps1` | 打无 Flutter/无 Dart 的包 `dist\AirBridge32-headless.zip` |

`Start-Chain.ps1` 的行为：

- 布局自适应：仓库（`build\...` + `upstream\...`）或打包目录（`backend\...`）；
- 启动前检查 TCP 49876 / 49877 / 8771 / 15353，占用即拒绝；
- 逐个等待 ready 行（`listening on 127.0.0.1:49876`、`waiting for awdld`、`host interface`、`receiving as`）；
- Ctrl+C 逆序停止，并复查端口是否释放；
- 把 `git rev-parse HEAD`、时间、频道/宽度写进 `chain.log`，每个后端单独 stdout/stderr 文件。

## 验证

```text
=== 仓库布局 dry-run ===
radio     ...\build\radio_usb\Release\airbridge_radio.exe 149 40
bridge    ...\build\radio_usb\Release\radio_pipe_bridge.exe
netd      ...\build\awdl_netd\Release\awdl_netd.exe   [AWDL_NETD_MDNS_PROXY=1]
awdld     ...\build\awdl\awdld.exe -c 149 -s 2 -j 400 -v
receiver  ...\build\python-embed\python.exe -u ...\upstream\winawdl\airdrop\receiver.py ...

Dry run only: no process started, no wireless frame sent.

=== 端口被占用（python -m http.server 49876）===
ports already in use: 49876; stop the other AirBridge32/radio instance first

=== 打包目录 dry-run ===
receiver  ...\dist\AirBridge32-headless\backend\python\python.exe -u ...\backend\airdrop\receiver.py ...
```

## 体积

| 产物 | 大小 |
| --- | --- |
| `dist\AirBridge32-headless.zip`（无 Flutter/Dart） | 16.0 MB |
| `dist\AirBridge32-headless\`（解压后） | 36.4 MB |
| `dist\AirBridge32-portable.zip`（Flutter 壳，旧） | 27.0 MB |

去掉 Flutter/Dart 直接省 11.0 MB，包内不再有 `flutter_windows.dll` 与 Dart 数据段。

